{"title":"2000 AMC 12 Problems/Problem 18","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><dl><dd><i>The following problem is from the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_12_Problems\" title=\"2000 AMC 12 Problems\">2000 AMC 12 #18</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_10_Problems\" title=\"2000 AMC 10 Problems\">2000 AMC 10 #25</a>, so those problems redirect to this page.</i></dd></dl>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_Power_Solve\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by Power Solve</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_12_Problems/Problem_18&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>In year <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/9/fc97ef67268cd4e91bacdf12b8901d7036c9a056.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" />, the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/c/2/1c2807fce47b1920524015703d24965ebdebf3f2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$300^{\\text{th}}$\" width=\"39\" height=\"15\" /> day of the year is a Tuesday. In year <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/7/f/a7fc8f668ffc0730528bca6447b71e28cebd0cf0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N+1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"50\" height=\"16\" />, the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/3/f533de2dedfd5b1d995ec09ac8b939f71196d2ce.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$200^{\\text{th}}$\" width=\"39\" height=\"15\" /> day is also a Tuesday. On what day of the week did the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/9/e59e2c6e83eb78cca610a5fd4070ae01c8d4ae60.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$100$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"29\" height=\"14\" /><sup>th</sup> day of year <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/2/5/a256c70ad4c46ec1127c5be68f8bb3075e9ced31.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N-1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"50\" height=\"16\" /> occur?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/a/01a53abbdf9e4f1d2c8b3ba3bc224211fd8b3d4a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text {(A)}\\ \\text{Thursday} \\qquad \\text {(B)}\\ \\text{Friday}\\qquad \\text {(C)}\\ \\text{Saturday}\\qquad \\text {(D)}\\ \\text{Sunday}\\qquad \\text {(E)}\\ \\text{Monday}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"578\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_12_Problems/Problem_18&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>There are either <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/2/9/62997404eccda827729e180344fb549322e5596b.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[65 + 200 = 265\\]\" width=\"118\" height=\"14\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/0/410b22f951be4fd0f5d55cc96280621336ed4ed4.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[66 + 200 = 266\\]\" width=\"118\" height=\"14\" /> days between the first two dates depending upon whether or not year <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/7/f/a7fc8f668ffc0730528bca6447b71e28cebd0cf0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N+1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"50\" height=\"16\" /> is a leap year (since the February 29th of the leap year would come between the 300th day of year <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/9/fc97ef67268cd4e91bacdf12b8901d7036c9a056.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" /> and 200th day of year <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/f/e0fcf01bef88eb69ac4d0a5b94a85a7ad21b913e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N + 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"47\" height=\"14\" />). Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/a/e0a0db32027a732ac57d37ef2ae9bb150f65b108.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> divides into <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/f/4/6f4eab6a44c458a2bc928db0947df1a0f5cf5ac7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$266$\" width=\"26\" height=\"12\" /> but not <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/8/4/b848614cce96e8899ec50264dff44d08c2a25253.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$265$\" width=\"26\" height=\"12\" />, for both days to be a Tuesday, year <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/9/fc97ef67268cd4e91bacdf12b8901d7036c9a056.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" /> must be a leap year.\n</p><p>Hence, year <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/2/5/a256c70ad4c46ec1127c5be68f8bb3075e9ced31.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N-1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"50\" height=\"16\" /> is not a leap year, and so since there are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/b/b/9bb28446bd7a88948b838d007a8a00e9e3f96965.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[265 + 300 = 565\\]\" width=\"127\" height=\"14\" /> days between the date in years <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/3/b/f3bf0177b734ee9d916d3662e2642eb1aceceb15.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N,\\text{ }N-1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"76\" height=\"16\" />, this leaves a remainder of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> upon division by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/a/e0a0db32027a732ac57d37ef2ae9bb150f65b108.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />. Since we are subtracting days, we count 5 days before Tuesday, which gives us  <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/3/9/839c1d7458788080a02e5cfa54c605d3721e463a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\mathbf{(A)} \\ \\text{Thursday}.}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"121\" height=\"29\" />\n</p><p>~ Anonymous, fixed by @johnzhou721\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_12_Problems/Problem_18&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/c/26c058d1f4c7d75c6098224bc48ff6252cb51d83.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$300-29\\cdot 7=97^{\\text{th}}$\" width=\"144\" height=\"15\" /> day of year <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/9/fc97ef67268cd4e91bacdf12b8901d7036c9a056.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" /> and the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/b/a/bba71d9b4232b5064181b567fd2308c3fea89482.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$200-15\\cdot 7=95^{\\text{th}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"144\" height=\"16\" /> day of year <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/7/f/a7fc8f668ffc0730528bca6447b71e28cebd0cf0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N+1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"50\" height=\"16\" /> are Tuesdays. If there were the same number of days in year <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/9/fc97ef67268cd4e91bacdf12b8901d7036c9a056.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" /> and year <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/b/ffb5f304075b979c6a16e4644bc00aba94e9630e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N-1,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"52\" height=\"16\" /> the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/4/364afa7d441183a25b0190f50cf2f32791b42f4d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$99^{\\text{th}}$\" width=\"30\" height=\"15\" /> day of year <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/2/5/a256c70ad4c46ec1127c5be68f8bb3075e9ced31.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N-1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"50\" height=\"16\" /> will be a Tuesday. But year <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/9/fc97ef67268cd4e91bacdf12b8901d7036c9a056.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" /> is a leap year because <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/f/3/7f3494b4c2879a1e2cf29221e747fb96809fb264.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$97-95 \\cong 366 \\pmod{7},$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"186\" height=\"18\" /> so the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/0/6/3067fda5e6e35bf24170cb4a52b133c01f977911.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$98^{\\text{th}}$\" width=\"30\" height=\"15\" /> day of year <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/2/5/a256c70ad4c46ec1127c5be68f8bb3075e9ced31.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N-1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"50\" height=\"16\" /> is a Tuesday. It follows that the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/0/3/d03d1fb723b8ac427ccfcf63129a2b454d2d75fd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$100^{\\text{th}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"39\" height=\"16\" /> day of year <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/2/5/a256c70ad4c46ec1127c5be68f8bb3075e9ced31.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N-1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"50\" height=\"16\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/3/9/839c1d7458788080a02e5cfa54c605d3721e463a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\mathbf{(A)} \\ \\text{Thursday}.}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"121\" height=\"29\" />\n</p><p>~dolphin7\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_Power_Solve\">Video Solution by Power Solve</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_12_Problems/Problem_18&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by Power Solve\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=E9w6_p6EXXo\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=E9w6_p6EXXo</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_12_Problems/Problem_18&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/aFJtbvTAmm4\">https://youtu.be/aFJtbvTAmm4</a>\n</p><p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=YfiUn8hLlpA\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=YfiUn8hLlpA</a>   ~David\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_12_Problems/Problem_18&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"2\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_12\" title=\"2000 AMC 12\">2000 AMC 12</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_12_Problems\" title=\"2000 AMC 12 Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_12_Answer_Key\" title=\"2000 AMC 12 Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_12_Problems/Problem_17\" title=\"2000 AMC 12 Problems/Problem 17\">Problem 17</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_12_Problems/Problem_19\" title=\"2000 AMC 12 Problems/Problem 19\">Problem 19</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_12_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2000 AMC 12 Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_12_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2000 AMC 12 Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_12_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2000 AMC 12 Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_12_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2000 AMC 12 Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_12_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2000 AMC 12 Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_12_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2000 AMC 12 Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_12_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2000 AMC 12 Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_12_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2000 AMC 12 Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_12_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"2000 AMC 12 Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_12_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"2000 AMC 12 Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_12_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"2000 AMC 12 Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_12_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"2000 AMC 12 Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_12_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"2000 AMC 12 Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_12_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"2000 AMC 12 Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_12_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"2000 AMC 12 Problems/Problem 15\">15</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_12_Problems/Problem_16\" title=\"2000 AMC 12 Problems/Problem 16\">16</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_12_Problems/Problem_17\" title=\"2000 AMC 12 Problems/Problem 17\">17</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">18</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_12_Problems/Problem_19\" title=\"2000 AMC 12 Problems/Problem 19\">19</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_12_Problems/Problem_20\" title=\"2000 AMC 12 Problems/Problem 20\">20</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_12_Problems/Problem_21\" title=\"20